# Cloudflare Pages — redirects (relative paths only).
#
# www -> apex is NOT handled here: Pages rejects absolute source URLs, so an
# earlier `https://www.fotoskiasis.com/*` line was silently ignored. Since
# 2026-09-25 it is a zone-level rule instead:
#
#   Cloudflare -> fotoskiasis.com -> Rules -> Redirect Rules
#     "Redirect from WWW to root [Template]": https://www.* -> https://${1}, 301
#     (path and query string carried over; needs the proxied DNS record
#      CNAME www -> fotoskiasis-preview.pages.dev)

